# Route: guide 1 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 1 to 15,
# 88 quests, 5.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Zephras Isle): Thendal Village -> Thendal Grove -> Thendal Standing
# Stones -> Thendal Village -> Thendal Standing Stones -> Thendal Village ->
# Shen'dar Village -> Shen'dar Highlands -> Shen'dar Village -> Windsong
# Standing Stones -> Shen'dar Village -> Shen'dar Highlands -> Shen'dar
# Village -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): WANTED: Vulgara the Insatiable
# (93318; Vulgara the Insatiable 8).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 97963 Camping
# 101: Alchemy; 97964 Camping 101: Blacksmithing; 97965 Camping 101: First
# Aid; 97967 Camping 101: Fishing; 97968 Camping 101: Herbalism; 97969 Camping
# 101: Leatherworking; 97970 Camping 101: Mining; 97971 Camping 101: Skinning;
# 97973 Camping 101: Tailoring; 98285 Camping 101: Engineering; 98286 Camping
# 101: Enchanting.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

